HdxColorCorrectionTask: fix OpenColorIO's 1D/2D LUT textures (OCIO v2 path)

Applied by tools/ci/build_usd_stack.ps1 to OpenUSD v26.08; the code is
unchanged on OpenUSD's dev branch (bc32a655a417, 2026-10-13). Without it every
OCIO view that uses 1D/2D LUT textures, among them the studio config's ACES
2.0 views, renders black in usdview and usdrecord on OpenGL and Vulkan:

- only 3D LUTs got a sampler name, so _CreateOpenColorIOShaderCode failed
  TF_VERIFY(!texName.empty() && !samplerName.empty()) and left the OCIO
  shader's samplers unbound;
- single-channel LUTs were created without data (the stored vector stayed
  empty, so initialData was null);
- RGB LUTs were counted as 4 floats per texel, reading past OCIO's 3-float
  buffer.

Upstream: PixarAnimationStudios/OpenUSD PR #3419 (open, fixes the first two)
and issue #3274. Delete this file when the OpenUSD tag in tools/deps.json has
the fix (docs/color_management.md, usdview).

diff --git a/pxr/imaging/hdx/colorCorrectionTask.cpp b/pxr/imaging/hdx/colorCorrectionTask.cpp
index 7503900..fd1b913 100644
--- a/pxr/imaging/hdx/colorCorrectionTask.cpp
+++ b/pxr/imaging/hdx/colorCorrectionTask.cpp
@@ -407,9 +407,11 @@ HdxColorCorrectionTask::_CreateOpenColorIOResourcesImpl(

         shaderDesc->getTextureValues(i, lutValues);

+        // OCIO provides one float per texel for TEXTURE_RED_CHANNEL and
+        // three (RGB) otherwise.
         int channelPerPix =
             channel == OCIO::GpuShaderCreator::TextureType::TEXTURE_RED_CHANNEL
-                ? 1 : 4;
+                ? 1 : 3;
         int valueCount = channelPerPix*width*height;
         HgiFormat fmt =
             channelPerPix == 1 ? HgiFormatFloat32 : HgiFormatFloat32Vec3;
@@ -421,6 +423,10 @@ HdxColorCorrectionTask::_CreateOpenColorIOResourcesImpl(
             fmt = HgiFormatFloat32Vec4;
             channelPerPix = 4;
             lutValues = float4AdaptedLutValues.data();
+        } else if (lutValues) {
+            // The texture is created from the stored values below, so keep
+            // a copy of single-channel LUTs too.
+            float4AdaptedLutValues.assign(lutValues, lutValues + valueCount);
         }

         // Texture description
@@ -444,6 +450,9 @@ HdxColorCorrectionTask::_CreateOpenColorIOResourcesImpl(

         // Sampler description
         HgiSamplerDesc sampDesc;
+        // The sampler name is substituted in the OCIO shader text on
+        // OpenGL and Vulkan (_CreateOpenColorIOShaderCode).
+        sampDesc.debugName = samplerName;
         sampDesc.magFilter =
             interpolation == OCIO::Interpolation::INTERP_NEAREST ?
                 HgiSamplerFilterNearest : HgiSamplerFilterLinear;
